#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Understand the Qiskit addon tools, which help you build utility-grade "
"quantum workflows."
msgstr ""
"Comprendre les extensions Qiskit, qui t'aident à construire des workflows "
"quantiques de qualité utilitaire."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Advanced techniques - Qiskit addons"
msgstr "Techniques avancées - Extensions Qiskit"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore lightcones */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore lightcones */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Advanced techniques - Qiskit addons {#advanced-techniques-qiskit-addons}"
msgstr ""
"Techniques avancées - Extensions Qiskit {#advanced-techniques-qiskit-addons}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit addons are a collection of research capabilities for enabling "
"algorithm discovery at the utility scale. These modular software components "
"build on Qiskit’s performant foundation and can plug into a "
"[workflow](/guides/intro-to-patterns) to scale or design new quantum "
"algorithms. This page highlights the available tools across key functional "
"categories to help you choose relevant capabilities when building your "
"workflows.\n"
msgstr ""
"Les extensions Qiskit sont un ensemble de fonctionnalités de recherche "
"permettant la découverte d'algorithmes à l'échelle utilitaire. Ces "
"composants logiciels modulaires s'appuient sur les bases performantes de "
"Qiskit et peuvent s'intégrer dans un [workflow](/guides/intro-to-patterns) "
"pour faire évoluer ou concevoir de nouveaux algorithmes quantiques. Cette "
"page présente les outils disponibles dans les principales catégories "
"fonctionnelles pour t'aider à choisir les fonctionnalités pertinentes lors "
"de la construction de tes workflows.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Map domain problems {#map-domain-problems}"
msgstr "Correspondance de problèmes du domaine {#map-domain-problems}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These capabilities specialize in mapping domain problems into quantum operators and circuits for execution on a quantum computer.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Optimization mapper\"\n"
"      description=\"Model optimization problems and map them into representations that can be understood by a quantum computer.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-opt-mapper/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Optimization mapper\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"Ces fonctionnalités se spécialisent dans la correspondance de problèmes du domaine en opérateurs et circuits quantiques en vue de l'exécution sur un ordinateur quantique.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Mappeur d'optimisation\"\n"
"      description=\"Modélise des problèmes d'optimisation et les convertit en représentations compréhensibles par un ordinateur quantique.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-opt-mapper/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Optimization mapper\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Fermionic mapper\"\n"
"      description=\"Model fermionic quantum systems and map them to qubit operators and circuits.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-fermions/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Fermionic mapper\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Mappeur fermionique\"\n"
"      description=\"Modélise des systèmes quantiques fermioniques et les convertit en opérateurs et circuits de qubits.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-fermions/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Fermionic mapper\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"AQC-Tensor\"\n"
"      description=\"Construct high-fidelity circuits with reduced depth using approximate quantum compilation with tensor networks.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: AQC-Tensor\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"AQC-Tensor\"\n"
"      description=\"Construis des circuits haute fidélité avec une profondeur réduite grâce à la compilation quantique approchée avec des réseaux de tenseurs.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: AQC-Tensor\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Multi-product formulas\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce the Trotter error of Hamiltonian dynamics through a weighted combination of several circuit executions.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-mpf/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: MPF\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Formules multi-produits\"\n"
"      description=\"Réduis l'erreur de Trotter de la dynamique hamiltonienne grâce à une combinaison pondérée de plusieurs exécutions de circuits.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-mpf/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: MPF\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr "</CardGroup>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Optimize circuits for hardware execution {#optimize-circuits-for-hardware-"
"execution}"
msgstr ""
"Optimisation des circuits pour l'exécution matérielle {#optimize-circuits-"
"for-hardware-execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These capabilities are useful for reducing circuit depth and typically come with an increased sampling overhead.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Operator backpropagation\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce circuit depth in expectation value estimations by backpropagating observables through the circuit.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-obp/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: OBP\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"Ces fonctionnalités sont utiles pour réduire la profondeur des circuits et s'accompagnent généralement d'une surcharge d'échantillonnage accrue.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Rétropropagation d'opérateurs\"\n"
"      description=\"Réduis la profondeur des circuits dans les estimations de valeurs d'espérance en rétropropageant les observables à travers le circuit.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-obp/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: OBP\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Circuit cutting\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce the depth of transpiled circuits by decomposing entangling gates between non-adjacent qubits.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-cutting\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Circuit cutting\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Découpage de circuits\"\n"
"      description=\"Réduis la profondeur des circuits transpilés en décomposant les portes d'intrication entre des qubits non adjacents.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-cutting\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Circuit cutting\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Manage noise for expectation value estimation {#manage-noise-for-"
"expectation-value-estimation}"
msgstr ""
"Gestion du bruit pour l'estimation de valeurs d'espérance {#manage-noise-"
"for-expectation-value-estimation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the following addons to manage noise when building quantum workloads "
"that estimate expectation values of observables.\n"
msgstr ""
"Utilise les extensions suivantes pour gérer le bruit lors de la construction"
" de charges de travail quantiques estimant les valeurs d'espérance "
"d'observables.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"  <Card\n"
"      title=\"Propagated noise absorption\"\n"
"      description=\"Mitigate expectation values by measuring a target observable that has absorbed noise model information.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-pna/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: PNA\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Shaded lightcones\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce probabilistic error cancellation (PEC) sampling overhead by removing noise model terms that have low impact on the observable estimation.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SLC\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"  <Card\n"
"      title=\"Absorption du bruit propagé\"\n"
"      description=\"Atténue les valeurs d'espérance en mesurant un observable cible qui a absorbé les informations du modèle de bruit.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-pna/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: PNA\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Cônes de lumière ombrés\"\n"
"      description=\"Réduis la surcharge d'échantillonnage de l'annulation d'erreurs probabiliste (PEC) en supprimant les termes du modèle de bruit qui ont peu d'impact sur l'estimation de l'observable.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SLC\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Manage noise for sampling results {#manage-noise-for-sampling-results}"
msgstr ""
"Gestion du bruit pour les résultats d'échantillonnage {#manage-noise-for-"
"sampling-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "These techniques are useful for managing noise on sampling results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ces techniques sont utiles pour gérer le bruit sur les résultats "
"d'échantillonnage.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<CardGroup>\n"
msgstr "<CardGroup>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sample-based quantum diagonalization\"\n"
"      description=\"Estimate the spectrum of quantum Hamiltonians by processing noisy samples and diagonalizing in a reduced subspace.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/qiskit-addons-sqd\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Overview page: SQD\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Overview\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Diagonalisation quantique par échantillonnage\"\n"
"      description=\"Estime le spectre des hamiltoniens quantiques en traitant des échantillons bruités et en diagonalisant dans un sous-espace réduit.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/qiskit-addons-sqd\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Overview page: SQD\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Overview\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"SQD for HPC\"\n"
"      description=\"An HPC-ready implementation of the SQD addon, written in modern C++17 standards and designed to enable HPC workflows and applications.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-sqd-hpc/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SQD for HPC\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"SQD pour HPC\"\n"
"      description=\"Une implémentation de l'extension SQD prête pour le calcul haute performance, écrite selon les standards modernes C++17 et conçue pour les workflows et applications HPC.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-sqd-hpc/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SQD for HPC\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Measurement-based postselection\"\n"
"      description=\"Filter out non-Markovian noise in circuits by incorporating measurement-based postselection transpiler passes.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/apidocs/qiskit_addon_utils.noise_management.post_selection.transpiler.passes.html\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page for post-selection\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Read the API reference\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Post-sélection basée sur les mesures\"\n"
"      description=\"Filtre le bruit non markovien dans les circuits en incorporant des passes de transpileur de post-sélection basées sur les mesures.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/apidocs/qiskit_addon_utils.noise_management.post_selection.transpiler.passes.html\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page for post-selection\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Read the API reference\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Matrix-free Measurement Mitigation (M3)\"\n"
"      description=\"Mitigate measurement errors by processing in a reduced subspace defined by noisy bitstrings.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-mthree/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: M3\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Mitigation des mesures sans matrice (M3)\"\n"
"      description=\"Atténue les erreurs de mesure en traitant dans un sous-espace réduit défini par des chaînes de bits bruitées.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-mthree/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: M3\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Supporting capabilities {#supporting-capabilities}"
msgstr "Fonctionnalités de support {#supporting-capabilities}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use these capabilities to support and compose your workflows that leverage other addons.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"  <Card\n"
"      title=\"Addon utilities\"\n"
"      description=\"Build addons-powered workflows faster by using this collection of functions for creating Hamiltonians, generating Trotter time-evolution circuits, and applying the latest error mitigation capabilities.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: addon utilities\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"Utilise ces fonctionnalités pour soutenir et composer tes workflows tirant parti d'autres extensions.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"  <Card\n"
"      title=\"Utilitaires d'extensions\"\n"
"      description=\"Accélère la construction de workflows basés sur des extensions grâce à cette collection de fonctions pour créer des hamiltoniens, générer des circuits d'évolution temporelle de Trotter et appliquer les dernières fonctionnalités de mitigation d'erreurs.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: addon utilities\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Pauli propagation\"\n"
"      description=\"A framework to approximate operator evolution, which can be used to simulate expectation values and implement error mitigation techniques, such as propagated noise absorption (PNA) and shaded lightcones.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/pauli-prop/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: pauli propagation\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Propagation de Pauli\"\n"
"      description=\"Un cadre pour approximer l'évolution d'opérateurs, qui peut être utilisé pour simuler des valeurs d'espérance et implémenter des techniques de mitigation d'erreurs, telles que l'absorption du bruit propagé (PNA) et les cônes de lumière ombrés.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/pauli-prop/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: pauli propagation\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
